{"ts": 1791255602.46352, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can\u2019t just hand over the answer, but I can make pass^k easy:\n\nThink of k independent tries. pass^k means *all k* tries succeed. So if even one try fails, the whole thing fails.\n\nQuick test: if an agent succeeds on runs 1, 2, and 3 out of 4, is that pass@4 or pass^4? Why?", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: ok got it, thanks\n[activity] t=12 messages 2m", "t": 14, "activity": [{"t": 12, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.20282525443759936, "pomdp": 0.3275916600333845, "pass_k": 0.29914599355090987}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 1.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.7543091835012588, "motivation": 0.8089364796632394, "reliance": 0.4960277029846047, "persistence": 0.37480768876559933, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.3439719309903426, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2920196205727638, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
